<title>NETHERLANDS: Chirac, Jospin welcome EU budget pact -official.</title>
<headline>Chirac, Jospin welcome EU budget pact -official.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>An agreement reached by EU finance ministers on a budget pact and growth and jobs resolution is in line with the provisions of both French President Jacques Chirac and Prime Minister Lionel Jospin, a spokeswoman for Chirac said.</p>
<p>Spokeswoman Catherine Colonna said Chirac had welcomed the agreement &quot;obtained thanks to a perfect coordination between the President and the Prime Minister&quot; she told a news conference.</p>
<p>&quot;It is in line with the position drawn up together,&quot; she said.</p>
</text>
